<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">ORDER REVIEW</view><view class="title">付款审核</view><view class="subtitle">付款后保留十分钟审核窗口，超时按管理员设置自动处理。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="row"><view class="card-title">{{order.item}}</view><text class="tag {{order.status === '已审核' ? 'green' : order.status === '已驳回' ? 'red' : ''}}">{{order.status}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{order.status === '待审核'}}" class="review-timer"><text>审核倒计时</text><text>{{countdown}}</text></view><view class="detail-line">订单编号：{{order.id}}</view><view class="detail-line">发起代理人：<text class="strong">{{order.agentName}}</text><text wx:if="{{order.userWechatName}}"> · 用户：{{order.userWechatName}}</text></view><view class="detail-line">展示商家：{{order.merchant}}</view><view class="detail-line">餐品规格：{{order.detail}}</view><view class="detail-line">客户实付：<text class="strong">¥{{order.payAmount}}</text></view><view class="detail-line">代理人结算：<text class="strong">¥{{order.settleAmount}}</text></view><view class="detail-line">付款状态：{{order.paid ? '已提交付款' : '未付款'}}</view><view wx:if="{{order.paidAt}}" class="detail-line">付款时间：已提交</view><view class="proof"><view class="proof-icon">票</view><view><view class="card-title" style="font-size:28rpx">客户付款凭证</view><view class="muted">{{order.paid ? '客户已提交付款通知，可预览订单' : '用户未付款，不进入审核流程'}}</view></view></view><button class="ghost" bindtap="preview">预览客户代付页</button><view wx:if="{{order.status === '待审核'}}"><view class="auto-note">超时处理：{{timeoutAction}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="approve">审核通过并结算</button><button class="ghost danger" bindtap="reject">驳回订单</button></view><view wx:if="{{order.status !== '待审核'}}" class="notice">该订单当前状态为「{{order.status}}」。</view></view></view>
